er tapes before but this mouth tape sticks well and comes off easily without pulling any hair. Highly recommend for other bearded folks!</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-MQf9dBXa_text","label":"gg-MQf9dBXa_text","default":"Jacob S."},{"type":"html","id":"ggCy9s2UPh1_text","label":"ggCy9s2UPh1_text","default":"<p>Verified Buyer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggtXcdIcKsf_text","label":"ggtXcdIcKsf_text","default":"Works Like a Charm"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBsPyA4nIi_text","label":"ggBsPyA4nIi_text","default":"<p>My husband and I both use Gudslip® now. We’ve noticed fewer interruptions at night due to snoring. It’s comfortable and doesn't leave any residue in the morning.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggRx-CFb1cG_text","label":"ggRx-CFb1cG_text","default":"Sarah Gill"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGILTVk4Lk_text","label":"ggGILTVk4Lk_text","default":"<p>Verified Buyer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggP-g934qmL_text","label":"ggP-g934qmL_text","default":"Excellent Product"},{"type":"html","id":"ggoIg0tWrYe_text","label":"ggoIg0tWrYe_text","default":"<p>Mouth tape has helped with my snoring and my wife is thrilled. The tape is easy to apply, and I barely notice it while sleeping.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrh-D-e01__text","label":"ggrh-D-e01__text","default":"George Marsh"},{"type":"html","id":"gggBT5__Ci9_text","label":"gggBT5__Ci9_text","default":"<p>Verified Buyer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBp1zK1WZi_text","label":"ggBp1zK1WZi_text","default":"Effective but Takes Getting Used To"},{"type":"html","id":"ggN_kTubvgA_text","label":"ggN_kTubvgA_text","default":"<p>The tape definitely helps improve my sleep quality by reducing snoring. It was a bit strange to use at first, but now I'm completely used to it.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg7zfvSkZ4B_text","label":"gg7zfvSkZ4B_text","default":"Jessica Thomas"},{"type":"html","id":"ggz4erOX1H6_text","label":"ggz4erOX1H6_text","default":"<p>Verified Buyer</p>"}],
